{
  "$comment": "enabledPlugins below works from project scope. extraKnownMarketplaces does NOT: Claude Code reads it from operator scopes only (policy/flag/user settings) unless the workspace trust dialog has been accepted, which cloud sessions never do. The four git marketplaces are therefore a declarative record here, and are registered per-machine in user scope by .claude/bootstrap-plugins.sh. See SETUP.md.",
